  "@readerSizePixelsSpoken": {
    "description": "⚠️ **The SPOKEN figure, and deliberately not the same string.** § 5's announcement is *\"Large, 20 pixels, not selected\"*; `20pt` read aloud is an abbreviation a screen reader has to guess at. One number, two renderings, two keys — a translation cannot merge them.",
    "placeholders": {
